00:30:43.449 --> 00:30:44.949
Aku mohon, pak.

00:30:45.618 --> 00:30:48.086
Tuan-tuan, aku mohon.

00:30:48.287 --> 00:30:50.050
Tidak! Aku mohon!

00:30:50.256 --> 00:30:52.349
Tidak!

00:30:52.592 --> 00:30:56.756
