00:37:08.567 --> 00:37:10.067
Tidak!

00:37:10.069 --> 00:37:11.730
Tidak!

00:37:13.038 --> 00:37:14.699
Tidak!

00:37:27.286 --> 00:37:29.345
Doc! / Tidak!

