00:40:52.157 --> 00:40:53.749
Cepatlah.

00:40:58.998 --> 00:41:00.431
Red!

00:41:00.432 --> 00:41:01.932
Pergilah dengan rombongan.

00:41:02.601 --> 00:41:04.101
Sekarang, sial!

00:41:11.844 --> 00:41:13.744
Apa yang kau lakukan?

00:41:17.683 --> 00:41:19.378
Misi baru?

00:41:20.185 --> 00:41:21.685
Tidak.

00:41:21.787 --> 00:41:23.287
Misi yang sama.

00:41:24.423 --> 00:41:26.084
Atur mereka, Zee.

00:41:36.201 --> 00:41:39.864
Tuhan melindungimu. Ambil salib ini.

00:41:40.039 --> 00:41:41.700
Ayo!

00:41:41.874 --> 00:41:44.638
Kita berangkat sekarang.

00:41:44.810 --> 00:41:47.040
Ayo! Menyingkirlah!

00:41:49.148 --> 00:41:50.911
Menyingkirlah!

00:41:51.083 --> 00:41:53.551
