Terkunci.

00:53:34.686 --> 00:53:36.186
Ayo.

00:53:44.362 --> 00:53:45.862
Sudah di posisi.

00:54:39.450 --> 00:54:41.441
Sial.

00:54:46.157 --> 00:54:47.749
Selalu terjadi setiap hari.

00:55:04.175 --> 00:55:06.006
